				"⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1955,
				26
			],
			"Message": "style(Wind): Normalize indentation and export formatting across ESBuild and bridge definitions\n\nReformat all ESBuild configuration modules under `Configuration/ESBuild/` and `Source/ESBuild.js` to use 4-space indentation, replacing previous tab or 2-space inconsistencies. Reorder imports to place local modules before external ones where appropriate, and consolidate `export` statements into multi-line blocks for improved readability.\n\nAdditionally, collapse multiline `Pick` type definitions in `Source/Effect/*/Implementation/*BridgeShapeGenerated.ts` files into single-line declarations. This standardizes the appearance of bridge shape contracts across all workbench service implementations (UserSettings, WorkbenchActivity, WorkbenchClipboard, etc.).\n\nNo functional changes to the build pipeline or type definitions; these are purely cosmetic adjustments to align with project styling guidelines.",
			"SHA": "46960a2578b4bc1acfd6ff5686cadc0fd18c98e6"
		},
